      "title": "CMake: Set CMAKE_MODULE_PATH in our plugin example.",
      "message": "CMake: Set CMAKE_MODULE_PATH in our plugin example.\n\nAs of 379352ef7f, epan no longer exports GLib's include path. In the\nexample CMakeLists.txt, set CMAKE_MODULE_PATH so that we can find GLIB2\nand add its include path.\n",
